Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): ours (SDL3 run-time loader, XInput fallback) over upstream's SDL2 backend; upstream's general pieces kept (pad_host_release centred sticks #496, poll lock, ASSIGN_CHANGES status, empty-slot recheck #581, run-time XInput load #494 called from pad_init_backend); upstream's SDL2 rumble/#372 hold code dropped (4010 has its own).

